{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56486","headline":"灵草歌 金灯草 · 白云仙人","name":"灵草歌 金灯草","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此草味教辛，仙家唤金灯。\n生服能治病，一载自身轻。\n伏砒砒能白，结汞汞转新。\n不然济人命，兼取汞中庚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白云仙人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56486.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56486","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}